==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|sextán]]'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*sehstehun}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''sextán''' 

# '''[[sixteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[fimmtán#Icelandic|fimmtán]] and before [[sautján#Icelandic|sautján]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[sextándi]] {{m}}, [[sextánda]] {{f|n}}.

